> how can I get to the levels under Hell?
> Help, please!

Hope you didn't go through all rumors on this one like I
did (they're all misleading).  Get teleport control, and
read a cursed scroll of teleport.  I know that the Wizard
Class gets teleport control automatically after some level
around 18.  You'll see a message: You feel controlled.
If you go down a level, you'll see a message: You feel
uncontrolled (you've lost tele control).

Word of caution, all the levels of hell only have, up
staircases.  You'll have to work around this.
